      "description": "Yorkville America Investment Trust - Yorkville America 2X Inverse MANGOS Plus Daily Target ETF is an exchange traded fund launched by and managed by Yorkville America Equities, LLC. It invests in public equity markets. The fund invests directly, through derivatives and through other funds in stocks of companies operating across information technology, software, services, system software, software research, artificial intelligence software, technology hardware and equipment, storage, peripherals, data storage, development, commercialization and infrastructure buildout of artificial intelligence and related technologies sectors. It uses derivatives such as swaps and options to create its portfolio. It invests in growth and value stocks of companies across diversified market capitalization. Yorkville America Investment Trust - Yorkville America 2X Inverse MANGOS Plus Daily Target ETF was formed on September 22, 2026 and is domiciled in the United States.",
